flowchart TD
  A([Start]) --> B[Register and sign in]
  B --> C[AI-assisted onboarding: answer questions]
  C --> D[System extracts a structured profile]
  D --> E{Profile confirmed by the applicant?}
  E -- No --> C
  E -- Yes --> F[Browse programmes and open one]
  F --> G[Review requirements with sources and verification dates]
  G --> H[Rule engine compares the profile with each requirement]
  H --> I{Is the record Verified?}
  I -- No --> J[Outcome Unknown: explain and ask to verify on the official site]
  I -- Yes --> K{Requirement met?}
  K -- Yes --> L[Outcome Met]
  K -- No --> M[Outcome Not met or Pending, gap recorded]
  J --> N[Gap analysis]
  L --> N
  M --> N
  N --> O[Roadmap generator orders tasks by deadline and dependencies]
  O --> P{Deadline Verified?}
  P -- No --> Q[Tasks without dates, task to verify the deadline]
  P -- Yes --> R[Tasks dated back from the deadline]
  Q --> S[Applicant works through the roadmap and reminders]
  R --> S
  S --> T[Applicant submits on the official website]
  T --> U([Personalised roadmap completed])
